@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5205
@sample_id = 3f2c9a1e-1111-4000-8000-000000000001

### Welcome / Root Endpoint
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/
Accept: text/plain

### Scalar Documentation
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/scalar/v1
Accept: text/html

### Case 01: Valid Competitor, partly paid (201 Created)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "participantName": "Juan Dela Cruz",
  "contactNumber": "09171234567",
  "email": "juan.delacruz@example.com",
  "address": "123 Rizal St., Naga City",
  "carMakeModel": "Toyota Supra MK4",
  "plateNumber": "TST 1001",
  "registrationType": "Competitor",
  "amountPaid": 1000.00
}

### Case 02: Valid Exhibitor, not paid (201 Created)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations
Content-Type: application/json
