### Case 05: Client tries to set server-only fields (201 Created)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "participantName": "Juan Dela Cruz",
  "contactNumber": "09171234567",
  "email": "juan.delacruz@example.com",
  "address": "123 Rizal St., Naga City",
  "carMakeModel": "Toyota Supra MK4",
  "plateNumber": "TST 1005",
  "registrationType": "VIP",
  "amountPaid": 0.00,
  "registrationFee": 1,
  "status": "Confirmed",
  "registrationNumber": "HACK-1"
}

