### Case 12: Text longer than allowed (400 Bad Request)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "participantName": "Juan Dela Cruz Long Name Exceeding One Hundred Fifty Characters In Length Which Should Be Rejected By The FluentValidation ParticipantName Rule In Application Slice",
  "contactNumber": "09171234567",
  "email": "juan.delacruz@example.com",
  "address": "123 Rizal St., Naga City",
  "carMakeModel": "Toyota Supra MK4",
  "plateNumber": "TST 1012",
  "registrationType": "Competitor",
  "amountPaid": 1000.00
}

