### Case 14: Default list (200 OK)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations
Accept: application/json

### Case 15: Newest first (200 OK)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Case 16: Second page, custom size (200 OK)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations?page=2&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

### Case 17: Page past the end (200 OK)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations?page=999
Accept: application/json

### Case 18: Invalid page (400 Bad Request)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations?page=0
Accept: application/json

### Case 19: Page size too large (400 Bad Request)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations?pageSize=100
Accept: application/json

### Case 20: Find by type (200 OK)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations?type=VIP
Accept: application/json

### Case 21: Find by status (200 OK)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations?status=Confirmed
Accept: application/json

### Case 22: Find by participant name (200 OK)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations?participantName=juan
Accept: application/json

### Case 23: Name search ignores case (200 OK)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations?participantName=JUAN
Accept: application/json

### Case 24: Partial name match (200 OK)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations?participantName=dela
Accept: application/json

### Case 25: Combined filters (200 OK)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations?type=Competitor&status=Pending&participantName=juan
Accept: application/json

### Case 26: No matches (200 OK)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations?participantName=zzzzzz
Accept: application/json

### Case 27: Invalid type (400 Bad Request)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations?type=Sponsor
Accept: application/json

### Case 28: Invalid status (400 Bad Request)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations?status=Done
Accept: application/json

### Case 29: Find registration by existing ID (200 OK)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations/{{sample_id}}
Accept: application/json

### Case 30: ID that doesn't exist (404 Not Found)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### Case 31: Not a valid GUID (404 Not Found)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations/abc
Accept: application/json

### Case 32: KPI summary (200 OK)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations/summary
Accept: application/json

### Case 37: Summary updates after a new registration (201 Created)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "participantName": "Juan Dela Cruz",
  "contactNumber": "09171234567",
  "email": "juan.delacruz@example.com",
  "address": "123 Rizal St., Naga City",
